[COMMENTS]
STATION,Velocity area station gauging a natural mountainous catchment. GENERAL: Open channel section with gravel control. Station added to peak flows dataset in October 2018 (WINFAP Files v7). STATION HYDROMETRY: No cableway. High flow gaugings carried out by ADCP boat. Good confidence in high flows. Gauged to around QMED. Two peak flow ratings across period of record. FLOW RECORD: Low flows in July 2013 verified by multiple low flow gaugings during the month, therefore thought to be reliable. FLOW REGIME: Micro-hydropower scheme in operation from mid-2017 onwards.
CATCHMENT,A natural mountainous catchment with a number of small lochs. Mainly pasture, rough grazing, moorland and peat bog with some forestry.
Qmed Suitability,Reasonable fit to rating. Gauged above bankfull and to near AMAX 1.
Pooling Suitability,Reasonable fit to rating. Gauged above bankfull and to near AMAX 1.
